			"notes": "### Bug Fixes\n- Fixed patrols spawning too frequently and piling up while AFK, causing lag (#1).\n  - Wild patrols now use a single, longer spawn timer instead of two overlapping ones.\n  - Added a per-area cap (16 units within 48 blocks) so patrols can't over-accumulate.\n  - Command-post patrols now spawn once when you enter the area instead of repeatedly.\n  - Patrol units are no longer permanently loaded, so stragglers despawn normally.\n- Bee Golems no longer damage each other — go ahead and summon a full explosive bee swarm!\n\n**Downloads:** pick the jar matching your loader and Minecraft version.\n- Minecraft 1.21.11 — `millager-fabric-1.21.11-...` / `millager-neoforge-1.21.11-...`\n- Minecraft 26.1–26.1.2 — `millager-fabric-26.1.2-...` / `millager-neoforge-26.1.2-...`"
		}
